	(property "Description" "SHOU HAN TYPE-C 16P LTH6.8 (LCSC C5187468): vertical USB Type-C receptacle, USB 2.0, 16 contacts, 6.80 mm over the board; 16 SMT pads 0.30 x 0.87 in two rows, four shell legs in plated 0.85 x 0.60 slots (pads S1-S4, pasted for pin-in-paste), two locating posts (round 0.52 and slotted 0.72 x 0.52 NPTH). Land from the maker's recommended layout; the legs are 0.95 mm long and the maker recommends a 0.8 mm board, so on 1.6 mm they reach about 60 % into the slot."
